{"about_the_game":"AchBall is a casual game in which you hit goals by launching a ball. You score extra points for each time the ball bounces.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Shoot the ball toward the goal, but remember each time the ball hits a wall you will get 10 points.<br><br><br>There are 80 levels divided into 4 sets. Each set has something different such as moving platforms, fragile blocks, and cobwebs. There are leaderboards for each level and for a full completion. Get the highest scores possible and compare your scores with friends or other players around the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Precisely tuned mechanics<br></li><li>80 interesting levels<br></li><li>Relaxing soundtracks<br></li><li>Achievements<br></li><li>Leaderboards<br></li><li>Gamepad support<br></li><li>Cloud save support</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"059c98fcb53cdaae6e7a20f0b21944fe7ee2e238.jpg","localized_name":"Fun is just getting started","name":"Fun is just getting started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/739180/059c98fcb53cdaae6e7a20f0b21944fe7ee2e238.jpg"},{"icon":"761c2ab892c809b0cc13db1e3dca2359688d99f4.jpg","localized_name":"Halfway","name":"Halfway","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/739180/761c2ab892c809b0cc13db1e3dca2359688d99f4.jpg"},{"icon":"c34bc473f736fbdb6c52f6d8c342afbcbb5d4062.jpg","localized_name":"Almost","name":"Almost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/739180/c34bc473f736fbdb6c52f6d8c342afbcbb5d4062.jpg"},{"icon":"387220c5fec41c4dbee9c3e4fd186e29edb7ff3f.jpg","localized_name":"Excellent","name":"Excellent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/739180/387220c5fec41c4dbee9c3e4fd186e29edb7ff3f.jpg"},{"icon":"2c97eb275ee7bcf2cd66f677b45c0cff60ef1ac2.jpg","localized_name":"Hit it","name":"Hit it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommu